{"id":"10640aec74cc5cc9","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-prg.md","title":"df-prg (Pseudorandom Generator)","display":"df-prg (Pseudorandom Generator)","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","display":"df-prg (Pseudorandom Generator)","label":"28-df-prg","type":"definition","aliases":["28-df-prg","PRG","Pseudorandom Generator"],"depends_on":["[[28-df-negl]]","[[28-df-ppt]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"source_book_location":"Definition 9.8; printed p.180; PDF p.206","source_printed_pages":"180","source_pdf_pages":"206","source_status":"statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"display","html":"df-prg (Pseudorandom Generator)"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-prg"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-prg</span><span>PRG</span><span>Pseudorandom Generator</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 9.8; printed p.180; PDF p.206"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"180"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"206"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\">\\(G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(\\ell:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> 在一元输入上多项式时间可计算。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_j\">\\(U_j\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^j\">\\(\\Sigma^j\\)</span> 上均匀分布；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\">\\(D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\)</span> 为均匀一比特输出区分器，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b75200f005282ddf\" href=\"?note=b75200f005282ddf\" title=\"28-df-ppt\">28-df-ppt</a>；每项概率包括其独立随机性。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Negl}\">\\(\\mathrm{Negl}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f3171800627deef3\" href=\"?note=f3171800627deef3\" title=\"28-df-negl\">28-df-negl</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRG}(G,\\ell)\">\\(\\operatorname{PRG}(G,\\ell)\\)</span> 为具有指定伸长的安全生成器谓词，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PRG}\">\\(\\mathbf{PRG}\\)</span> 为所有这种生成器的类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Adv}_{D,G,\\ell}(n)\\coloneqq\\left|\\Pr[D(G(U_n))=1]-\\Pr[D(U_{\\ell(n)})=1]\\right|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Adv}_{D,G,\\ell}(n)\\coloneqq\\left|\\Pr[D(G(U_n))=1]-\\Pr[D(U_{\\ell(n)})=1]\\right|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PRG}(G,\\ell)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ G\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\land\\left[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\ell(n)&gt;n\\land\\forall s\\in\\Sigma^n\\;|G(s)|=\\ell(n)\\bigr)\\right]\\land\\left[\\forall D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\operatorname{Adv}_{D,G,\\ell}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PRG}(G,\\ell)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ G\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\land\\left[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\ell(n)&gt;n\\land\\forall s\\in\\Sigma^n\\;|G(s)|=\\ell(n)\\bigr)\\right]\\land\\left[\\forall D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\operatorname{Adv}_{D,G,\\ell}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{PRG}\\coloneqq\\{G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*: \\exists\\ell\\;\\operatorname{PRG}(G,\\ell)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{PRG}\\coloneqq\\{G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*: \\exists\\ell\\;\\operatorname{PRG}(G,\\ell)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应定义 9.8，区分器只接收样本串。把伸长函数纳入优势签名，修复原稿中类内存在量化的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 与类外自由参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\">\\(\\ell\\)</span> 混用。效率约束同时保证输出长度为多项式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-negl]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-ppt]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-polynomial-time-function","status":"resolved","id":"adb92775ec020a0b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$；$\\ell:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 在一元输入上多项式时间可计算。$\\mathbf{FP}$ 见 [[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-ppt","status":"resolved","id":"b75200f005282ddf","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U_j$ 为 $\\Sigma^j$ 上均匀分布；$D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}$ 为均匀一比特输出区分器，见 [[28-df-ppt]]；每项概率包括其独立随机性。$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-negl","status":"resolved","id":"f3171800627deef3","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U_j$ 为 $\\Sigma^j$ 上均匀分布；$D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}$ 为均匀一比特输出区分器，见 [[28-df-ppt]]；每项概率包括其独立随机性。$\\mathrm{Negl}$ 见 [[28-df-negl]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{FP}","display":false},{"tex":"U_j","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma^j","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Negl}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PRG}(G,\\ell)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PRG}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Adv}_{D,G,\\ell}(n)\\coloneqq\\left|\\Pr[D(G(U_n))=1]-\\Pr[D(U_{\\ell(n)})=1]\\right|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{PRG}(G,\\ell)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ G\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\land\\left[\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(\\ell(n)>n\\land\\forall s\\in\\Sigma^n\\;|G(s)|=\\ell(n)\\bigr)\\right]\\land\\left[\\forall D\\in\\mathbf{PPT}\\;\\operatorname{Adv}_{D,G,\\ell}\\in\\mathrm{Negl}\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{PRG}\\coloneqq\\{G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*: \\exists\\ell\\;\\operatorname{PRG}(G,\\ell)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell","display":false}],"bytes":1706,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-155","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"基础安全概念：[[28-df-ppt]]、[[28-df-negl]]、[[28-df-one-way-function]]、[[28-df-hardcore-predicate]]、[[28-df-prg]]、[[28-df-prf]]。"},{"id":"1f166040771c1b1d","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$G:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$，$d:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 满足 $d(0)=1$ 且 $d(n)=2n$ 对 $n\\ge1$，$\\forall s\\in\\Sigma^*\\;|G(s)|=d(|s|)$；$\\operatorname{PRG}(G,d)$ 采用 [[28-df-prg]] 的均匀PPT量词。$\\operatorname{PRF}$ 采用 [[28-df-prf]] 的自适应多项式时间预言机区分器。$m(n)=\\max\\{1,n\\}$；$F:\\Sigma^*\\times\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma^*$。$G_b:\\Sigma^+\\to\\Sigma^+$（$b\\in\\{0,1\\}$）将在下式按切片定义；字串下标从1开始，$\\Sigma^+=\\Sigma^*\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}$。"},{"id":"27512705907dad0b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{OWF}$ 见 [[28-df-one-way-function]]；$\\mathbf{PRG}$ 见 [[28-df-prg]]。二者均使用均匀概率多项式时间攻击者。"},{"id":"537a0f14593b849b","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$G\\in\\mathbf{FP}$，$\\ell:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$ 在一元输入上多项式时间可计算，$\\ell(n)>n$ 且 $\\forall s\\in\\Sigma^n\\;|G(s)|=\\ell(n)$。$\\operatorname{PRG}(G,\\ell)$ 采用 [[28-df-prg]] 的仅样本区分器接口。"}],"outgoing":["f3171800627deef3","b75200f005282ddf","adb92775ec020a0b"]}